{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>北角今日（18日）發生火警。下午5時17分，警方接報，港燈位於城市花園道28號的電燈中心，停車場電掣房發生爆炸。一名20餘歲男職員走避不及，臉部、雙手及右邊身體燒傷。</p><p>救援人員接報趕抵現場，消防動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，至下午5時30分停止動員。傷者清醒，由救護車送往瑪麗醫院治理；現場有約10名職員自行疏散。警方及消防正調查意外原因。《香港01》正就事件向港燈查詢。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防到場戒備。（左朗星攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199787538718789632473981.jpeg/nXDf7AF_L1zdFHbl_WFQ9Eo3xvl0CDAQrdtN0pfbTdI\"/><figcaption>消防到場戒備。（左朗星攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場有工程人員協助。（左朗星攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199787531311386624097586.jpeg/CoeZOnw1aLYUO0_n8hUmvQ277BnsXSwPqEjr-5JI6_s\"/><figcaption>現場有工程人員協助。（左朗星攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"北角港燈中心有電掣房爆炸。（左朗星攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199787527687376896683547.jpeg/xZNW9AT0m3l_vdszruVp4fKRISg2BHwiS-w85HHsPOQ\"/><figcaption>北角港燈中心有電掣房爆炸。（左朗星攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場戒備。（左朗星攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199786982172004352012764.jpeg/_X_yqaL4S3Mh409bRP2O9d3L4mWRDzkzaj1OjFA9Tow\"/><figcaption>消防到場戒備。（左朗星攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"約10名職員自行疏散。（左朗星攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199787534906036224958042.jpeg/oaPPqlz0jXNAtRPLu0CqlyDxPVH3XEq3XVCfWGdQn1g\"/><figcaption>約10名職員自行疏散。（左朗星攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:44:10.200209+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T10:21:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:37:21.398734+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:37:21.398734+00:00","content_hash":"30b77b45ea3c7f15ac22594ad7f659fdd4a5a227f3f19b608c85d0710655429e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}